#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:3
#: b4eb60f161cd487eb1b9c27d6bc0f7d5
msgid "空间关联磁矩（Correlated Spins）"
msgstr "Correlated Spins"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:5
#: 289adaf0ef154a3ba7fa9b50b38b0c75
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:7
#: 9cebbd421a474e0dbc19ef73c4206b30
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:9
#: dbcf647af51c4952ae75981cdbe896be
msgid "这张卡让**所有符合条件的非零磁矩**改变方向，并使相邻原子的方向变化具有统计相关性。它保持每个磁矩的模长不变，适合生成带短程磁关联的非共线结构。"
msgstr ""
"Change the directions of **all eligible nonzero moments** while making direction "
"changes on neighboring atoms statistically correlated. Moment magnitudes remain "
"unchanged, making the card suitable for noncollinear structures with short-range "
"magnetic correlations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:11
#: 17b0b562d5984f02ae0b5b80cbb047ae
msgid "它与相邻两张卡的区别是："
msgstr "It differs from the two neighboring cards as follows:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: b9ba4fa674b84f8abc3e0d038868581d
msgid "卡片"
msgstr "Card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: b20c2c9b9ba04a1ebe6248103bcf7271
msgid "哪些磁矩会变"
msgstr "Which Moments Change"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: f0ad1b91e92c49c68ab96e8d331f5e0e
msgid "方向变化是否空间相关"
msgstr "Are Direction Changes Spatially Correlated?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 50e650a82248455590859f5a3ced2a58
msgid "模长是否可变"
msgstr "Can Magnitudes Change?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 048a4f2f53ed4c919f674f243743ead0
msgid "磁矩无序采样"
msgstr "Moment Disorder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: ca013fb6606e4ee48cbcd468f4bb4ae7
msgid "随机选中的指定比例"
msgstr "A randomly selected fraction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 9ba035ffd5564444ad68683943b2589f a2244eaf393e442cbbec0ac534868d56
#: b4222016065d4ab3939c249b44b0c5e3 d90c2dbef7c9469db50324125eacf304
msgid "否"
msgstr "No"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 2664554440584a268ff3e51d44b99cc6
msgid "磁矩扰动"
msgstr "Moment Perturbation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 590a9abd358644fdb4abeb82eff443c1
msgid "所有目标磁矩"
msgstr "All target moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 10332e79f6104aa2b9732ed1a2369569
msgid "可选"
msgstr "Optional"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: bbfac3bad3b54b1baa62a0a568400c99
msgid "空间关联磁矩"
msgstr "Correlated Spins"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: 76e6419aff994beea42542aae28294f3
msgid "所有符合条件的磁矩"
msgstr "All eligible moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md
#: b973e9f83e404d8aab8ed0deee83e13e
msgid "是"
msgstr "Yes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:19
#: 926411a5638145c1a1d286c1e929ec17
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:21
#: 340d2cbeb0734dfca2e1446d0e51479b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "程序先计算参与原子间的周期最小镜像距离 $r_{ij}$，再构造协方差矩阵："
msgstr ""
"The program first computes periodic minimum-image distances $r_{ij}$ between "
"participating atoms, then constructs a covariance matrix:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:23
#: 7b7b81198c954b898240805f19bffdfa
msgid ""
"\n"
"K_{ij}^{\\mathrm{exp}}=\\exp(-r_{ij}/\\xi),\\qquad\n"
"K_{ij}^{\\mathrm{SE}}=\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac12(r_{ij}/\\xi)^2\\right].\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:28
#: 476bcc225ec7487fa4e150cd1f7466ea
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\xi$ 是 `correlation_length`。程序对 $K=LL^\\mathsf{T}$ 做 Cholesky 分解，并用 $u=Lz$ 把独立高斯随机数"
" $z$ 变为空间相关的三维随机场。"
msgstr ""
"$\\xi$ is `correlation_length`. The program performs the Cholesky decomposition "
"$K=LL^\\mathsf{T}$ and uses $u=Lz$ to transform independent Gaussian random numbers "
"$z$ into a spatially correlated three-dimensional random field."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:30
#: 4c88b08e4c20420983c680efddaa8d30
msgid "**替换为随机方向：** 直接归一化 $u_i$，再乘回原磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"**Replace with random directions:** normalize $u_i$ directly, then multiply by the "
"original moment magnitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:31
#: 912f9149a47b4246ba2df70b6d304426
msgid "**在当前方向附近扰动：** 相关场决定横向偏转的方位；每个原子的偏转角大小仍在圆锥范围内独立抽样。"
msgstr ""
"**Perturb around current directions:** the correlated field determines the azimuth of"
" the transverse tilt, while each atom's tilt-angle magnitude is still sampled "
"independently within the cone."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:33
#: 7f39371b13aa435e976948c238cddc2c
msgid ""
"因此，$\\xi$ 是**归一化前随机场的协方差长度**，不是输出自旋点积的精确衰减长度。应在同一组参数生成的多份结构上，统计 $\\langle\\hat "
"s_i\\cdot\\hat s_j\\rangle$ 随距离的变化；只看一份结构不能判断相关长度是否合理。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, $\\xi$ is the **covariance length of the random field before "
"normalization**, not the exact decay length of output spin dot products. Evaluate how"
" $\\langle\\hat s_i\\cdot\\hat s_j\\rangle$ varies with distance over multiple "
"structures generated with the same parameters; one structure alone cannot establish "
"whether the correlation length is reasonable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:35
#: a7c1fd6e3bd94e1bbb6998b3fa44496e
msgid "同一 $\\xi$ 下，平方指数核在近距离更平滑、相关更强，但远距离衰减更快；指数核的远距离尾部更长。"
msgstr ""
"At the same $\\xi$, the squared-exponential kernel is smoother and more strongly "
"correlated at short distances but decays faster at long distances; the exponential "
"kernel has a longer-distance tail."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:37
#: 18f7896a78a741f2baf8440871d26109
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:39
#: b2d9c8921cb84ad5851137a09186f0f3
msgid ""
"假设输入是一条原子间距约 1 Å 的 Fe 链，已有模长为 2 的矢量磁矩。选择“替换为随机方向”、指数核、$\\xi=3$ Å，并让每个输入生成 5 "
"份结构：近邻磁矩通常比远距离磁矩更相似，而所有磁矩模长仍为 2。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose the input is an Fe chain with an atomic spacing of about 1 Å and existing "
"vector moments of magnitude 2. Select `Replace with random directions`, the "
"exponential kernel, $\\xi=3$ Å, and five structures per input. Neighboring moments "
"are usually more similar than distant ones, while all moment magnitudes remain 2."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:41
#: 7074b204f0b743a0bed7000b4783984a
msgid "检查结果时建议："
msgstr "When checking the results:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:43
#: da34690653874f24b6cc8c5b6b707a80
msgid "确认每个输入确实得到 5 份结构。"
msgstr "confirm that each input produces five structures;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:44
#: 3fa4cd35901140d5b9114a3b773f035c
msgid "检查输出 `spin` 的形状为 `(N, 3)`，磁矩模长与输入一致。"
msgstr ""
"check that output `spin` has shape `(N, 3)` and that moment magnitudes match the "
"input;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:45
#: f4250409cc2c48d7b49df502df2dd5fb
msgid "对多份样本按原子间距分箱，比较归一化磁矩点积；增大 $\\xi$ 后，近邻方向应更一致。"
msgstr ""
"bin multiple samples by interatomic distance and compare normalized moment dot "
"products. Increasing $\\xi$ should make neighboring directions more consistent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:47
#: 73b9344330a64d02bdc620d98eeb255e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:49
#: 04899abbf0c646d88a00f5c0742a50ab
msgid "变化方式（mode）"
msgstr "Change Mode (mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:51
#: 79c671fe34da4ea9b17791c42142af72
msgid "默认 `Cone around reference`。选择“在当前方向附近扰动”时保留原磁态的大致方向；选择“替换为随机方向”时，所有符合条件的磁矩都改为相关随机方向。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Cone around reference`. `Perturb around current directions` preserves the "
"approximate direction of the original magnetic state, while `Replace with random "
"directions` changes every eligible moment to a correlated random direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:53
#: 1a4232bf65de41dbb6cd41c4b79cee23
msgid "相关轮廓（correlation_kernel）"
msgstr "Correlation Profile (correlation_kernel)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:55
#: 92a0964d5ffd44a9b3f92274b546ceb9
msgid "默认 `exponential`。指数核具有更长的远距离尾部；`squared_exponential` 在近距离更平滑，但远处衰减更快。"
msgstr ""
"Default `exponential`. The exponential kernel has a longer-distance tail; "
"`squared_exponential` is smoother at short distances but decays faster farther away."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:57
#: aeeafde7d0204f6ca0bc607ca9a96776
msgid "空间相关长度（correlation_length）"
msgstr "Spatial Correlation Length (correlation_length)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:59
#: 0d625b4f1927488eb1f149cb21704599
msgid "默认 3.0 Å。它控制潜在随机场随距离共同变化的尺度。远小于最近邻距离时，各原子的方向趋近独立；增大后会形成更大的同向变化区域。"
msgstr ""
"Default 3.0 Å. It controls the distance scale over which the latent random field "
"varies together. When it is much smaller than the nearest-neighbor distance, atomic "
"directions approach independence; increasing it creates larger regions of coherent "
"directional change."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:61
#: cba2e690764a46a7a7831f313d1b0890
msgid "每个输入的结构数（samples）"
msgstr "Structures per Input (samples)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:63
#: d53ffa90b61a4b3f8a61e203abebcfdb
msgid "默认 1。每个有效输入生成多少份独立随机结构。要判断空间相关性，通常需要多份样本进行统计。"
msgstr ""
"Default 1. Number of independent random structures generated for each valid input. "
"Assessing spatial correlation usually requires statistics over multiple samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:65
#: fff0341b86fa45bbb688b9e436c6d9fa
msgid "最大偏转角（cone_angle）"
msgstr "Maximum Tilt Angle (cone_angle)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:67
#: 4e09274157ae460eadbe2bb12193531c
msgid "默认 30°，仅在 `mode=Cone around reference` 时使用。它是相对输入方向的偏转上限；设为 0° 会生成保持参考方向的结构。"
msgstr ""
"Default 30°, used only when `mode=Cone around reference`. This is the upper bound on "
"tilt relative to the input direction; setting it to 0° generates structures that "
"preserve the reference directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:69
#: fbf7bbefeda3479ebee0a1a978a7e89c
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:71
#: 3e870950e1e04598b7ffff431f5f0e50
msgid ""
"默认 `Existing initial magmoms`。该模式只读取输入中的 `spin:R:3` 或 ASE "
"初始磁矩；输入没有磁矩时会报错，**不会**自动使用元素表。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Existing initial magmoms`. This mode reads only `spin:R:3` or ASE initial "
"moments from the input. If the input has none, it reports an error and **does not** "
"use the element table automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:73
#: 92bfb73e8faf415f9351392c3c5093ea
msgid "选择 `Map/default magnitude` 后，程序才会根据元素表和默认值建立初始模长。"
msgstr ""
"Only after selecting `Map/default magnitude` does the program construct initial "
"magnitudes from the element table and default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:75
#: 07847bad30624f608cc1ca0138cf6cd0
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:77
#: 47b17df3087446299d83570a8f3ab559
msgid "仅在元素表模式下使用。格式如 `Fe:2.2, Co:1.7`，为指定元素设置磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"Used only in element-table mode. A value such as `Fe:2.2, Co:1.7` sets moment "
"magnitudes for specified elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:79
#: 92cc1ea0fb1d4e3f92e0da63c7b2e498
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:81
#: 363d50279bb74e7f828a5d0034cfc3df
msgid "默认 0.0，仅在元素表模式下使用。它用于表中未列出的元素；设为 0 的原子不参与相关采样。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.0, used only in element-table mode. It applies to elements absent from the "
"table; atoms assigned zero do not participate in correlated sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:83
#: f593ea804507488b9e63378abaa1bc8e
msgid "标量磁矩转矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "Convert Scalar Moments to Vectors (lift_scalar)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:85
#: a0f08729ba174da381f8de7d1fd84a9f
msgid "默认开启，仅在读取已有磁矩时使用。输入只有标量磁矩时，沿 `axis` 把它们提升为三维矢量；关闭后，标量输入无法进行方向采样。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled by default and used only when reading existing moments. If the input has only"
" scalar moments, they are lifted along `axis` into three-dimensional vectors. With "
"this disabled, directional sampling cannot use scalar input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:87
#: 37744c924007402595443586bffca1ce
msgid "标量参考方向（axis）"
msgstr "Scalar Reference Direction (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:89
#: d9459df961b54665aac2975a50684744
msgid "默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。它只用于把标量磁矩或元素表生成的模长初始化为矢量；已有三维磁矩的方向不会被覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0, 0, 1)`. Used only to initialize scalar moments or element-table "
"magnitudes as vectors; directions of existing three-dimensional moments are not "
"overwritten."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:91
#: f6634b24e2c342f2bf6b717ead752423
msgid "目标元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "Target Elements (apply_elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:93
#: 7a9d793cb89146a39c711bb50fdd284c
msgid "默认留空，表示选择所有非零磁矩。可填写逗号分隔的元素符号，如 `Fe,Co`。未选中的原子保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default, selecting all nonzero moments. Enter comma-separated element "
"symbols such as `Fe,Co` to restrict selection. Unselected atoms remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:95
#: aaa54d046aac452bacdb6274e1fb90e2
msgid "最大参与磁矩数（max_atoms_for_full）"
msgstr "Maximum Participating Moments (max_atoms_for_full)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:97
#: 05b607910cd849ccb226e94ce5151e04
msgid ""
"默认 200。这是参与相关采样的**非零磁矩数量**上限，不是结构总原子数，也不是精度参数。因为精确协方差采样需要 $N\\times N$ 矩阵和 $O(N^3)$ "
"Cholesky 分解，超过上限时程序会停止并提示缩小目标元素或结构。"
msgstr ""
"Default 200. This limits the **number of nonzero moments participating** in "
"correlated sampling, not the total atom count and not numerical accuracy. Exact "
"covariance sampling requires an $N\\times N$ matrix and an $O(N^3)$ Cholesky "
"decomposition, so exceeding the limit stops the operation and asks you to narrow the "
"target elements or structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:99
#: 24de5b4aaff940219b4d80cf1ea30f37
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:101
#: 7a0ea401790845d58972bb976d8c989f
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，相同输入、参数和种子会生成相同结果，便于复现和对比。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, identical inputs, parameters, and seeds produce "
"identical results for reproducibility and comparison."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:103
#: 75322ee02d22477b8139d5519c934052
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:105
#: 30474b754aab4d6988b4719d2235b2d5
msgid "默认 0，仅在 `use_seed=True` 时生效。样本序号会参与派生种子的计算，因此同一输入生成的多份结构仍彼此不同。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0, used only when `use_seed=True`. The sample index participates in derived-"
"seed calculation, so multiple structures generated from the same input still differ "
"from one another."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:107
#: b1ac3c2fd1654924a0e6f6de0d297b0a
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:109
#: fcd4935fe19d4810928b55bbc0155620
msgid ""
"**为什么单份结构看不出设定的相关长度？** $\\xi$ 控制随机场的统计协方差。应对多份样本统计磁矩点积随距离的变化，而不是把单帧中的某个区域尺寸直接当作 "
"$\\xi$。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the specified correlation length not apparent in one structure?** $\\xi$ "
"controls the statistical covariance of the random field. Measure how moment dot "
"products vary with distance over multiple samples instead of treating a region size "
"in one frame as $\\xi$ directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:111
#: ae335b9596874beba5f35c7cfc412402
msgid "**为什么达到数量上限后直接停止？** 当前算法构造完整协方差矩阵并做 Cholesky 分解。上限约束的是参与采样的非零磁矩数；可缩小目标元素或使用更小的结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the operation stop when the count limit is reached?** The current "
"algorithm constructs a full covariance matrix and performs a Cholesky decomposition. "
"The limit applies to participating nonzero moments; narrow the target elements or use"
" a smaller structure."

