#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认空。按元素显式指定磁矩幅值，格式如 `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`。已知元素局域磁矩就填进去，未知元素别用默认值伪造先验。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. Explicit element "
